[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/593977486","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/987#issuecomment-593977486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/987","id":593977486,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU5Mzk3NzQ4Ng==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-03-03T14:26:05Z","updated_at":"2020-03-03T14:26:05Z","body":"I'm generally in favor of adding. This is the next version of the Parity license for which we added version 6.0.0 in release 3.6 ([XML](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/master/src/Parity-6.0.0.xml), #805)\r\n\r\n@kemitchell a couple of quick questions:\r\n\r\n- can you point to examples of current use of Parity-7.0.0 in the wild?\r\n- can you give a short summary of any significant substantive differences from 6.0.0 to 7.0.0?\r\n\r\nThank you!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/593977486/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/594038449","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/987#issuecomment-594038449","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/987","id":594038449,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU5NDAzODQ0OQ==","user":{"login":"waldyrious","id":478237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3ODIzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/478237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/waldyrious","html_url":"https://github.com/waldyrious","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waldyrious/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waldyrious/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waldyrious/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waldyrious/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waldyrious/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waldyrious/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waldyrious/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waldyrious/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/waldyrious/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-03-03T16:24:40Z","updated_at":"2020-03-03T16:24:40Z","body":"> can you give a short summary of any significant substantive differences from 6.0.0 to 7.0.0?\r\n\r\nSome links that could be useful (similar to the [list I compiled for the PR adding Prosperity 3.0.0](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/pull/960)):\r\n\r\n- [Announcement blog post](https://blog.licensezero.com/2019/11/04/Parity-7.html)\r\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/licensezero/parity-public-license/releases/tag/v7.0.0) in the license's repository\r\n- [List of commits](https://github.com/licensezero/parity-public-license/compare/v6.0.0...v7.0.0) between v6.0.0 and v7.0.0\r\n- [Full text of the 7.0.0 license](https://github.com/licensezero/parity-public-license/blob/v7.0.0/LICENSE.md), and [full text of the v6.0.0 license](https://github.com/licensezero/parity-public-license/blob/v6.0.0/LICENSE.mustache)\r\n\r\nOf these, the release notes seem to provide the most explicit human-readable summary of the changes:\r\n\r\n> - Rewrite based on the [API Copyleft License](https://github.com/kemitchell/api-copyleft-license), in the style of the [Blue Oak Model License](https://blueoakcouncil.org/license/1.0.0) and [Polyform Project](https://polyformproject.org) licenses.\r\n> - Add an explicit exception for prototypes.\r\n> - Add an explicit exception for reverse engineering closed software.\r\n> - Numerous improvements to copyleft rules.\r\n> - Use string-interpolation-style `$`-sigil placeholders.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/594038449/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/594072071","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/987#issuecomment-594072071","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/987","id":594072071,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU5NDA3MjA3MQ==","user":{"login":"kemitchell","id":205760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNTc2MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kemitchell","html_url":"https://github.com/kemitchell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kemitchell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kemitchell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kemitchell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ke